Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, watch as we pass by,\Nas we raise our flag, up high in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go now, sailing through the\Nendless ocean, facing all that comes by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for our treasure. Nobody has\Never got to witness with their own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is keep believing in our\Ndreams, And let our heart lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then once we got all the\Nothers left is to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When we face the dark and stormy weather?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.30,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the pace, we'll\Nlink our hearts together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm sure we'll make it through!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Start raising our flag as we journey on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.48,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Though our chances are close to\Nnone, We won't back down from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start off the chase!\NLet's start off the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toward our own dreams,\Nwhile keeping the pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With a compass pointing to our goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't stop till we've\Ngone around the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.16,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running along, keep running along!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll never stop,\Ntill we're at the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that we'll ever quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't keep heading for tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.04,0:01:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start up the chase!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see through your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What we'll have to face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All the memories will stay in our hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.38,0:01:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.38,0:02:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gates of Justice are really opening!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.35,0:02:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my years here, this is the\Nfirst time it's ever happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never even heard\Nof it happening before!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We must be letting the\Nbattleships from the headquarters
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,through the Buster Call\Nis about to let loose
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.24,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.94,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Granny Kokoro said the Gates of Justice\Nnever open all the way like that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This Buster Call thing\Nmust be really bad Even
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the Marines are in a\Npanic to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.58,0:02:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats picked a fight\Nwith the whole world They
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.60,0:02:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,might really burn down the\Nwhole island to get at them
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it in there, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You too, Straw Hat! Kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Franky can take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I was careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this new power of\Nhis took me by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you're doing seems\Nto be taking its toll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In shame, the fight was\Njust getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.08,0:03:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I can beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.38,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.90,0:03:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare leave yet, Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.24,0:03:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Guards, on to the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.90,0:04:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, men. Ready? Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Chief Spondheim\Nis on his way as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's delivering an\Nespecially heinous criminal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,across the bridge from the Tower of Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't happen often,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so I want all marines\Nfrom the escort ships
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,and all guards from the\Ngate here in top form!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Give them the best\Ndance salute you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All lined up and ready to sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a thing left to stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.56,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a surprise waiting\Nfor your little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,before we cross the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.72,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I set up a landmine at the top\Nof those stairs right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So in the unlikely event that someone\Nactually does come to save you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,they and the stairs will both go BOOM!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.70,0:05:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the elegant\Nsolution, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm excited at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.90,0:05:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I suppose neither of us\Nshould get our hopes up too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how no one will be coming\Nto help you in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.14,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go through that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.24,0:05:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I still believe they'll come to\Nsave me. They're not coming, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be burned to a crisp Just like\Neverything else in the Buster Calls path.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.76,0:05:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather convenient, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Every humiliation I've suffered,\Nincluding them shooting down our flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,will be erased as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like before, 20 years ago, when\Nthat marine giant attacked us in Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.24,0:06:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That means on your own two feet, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.92,0:06:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.88,0:06:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.76,0:06:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I'm a friggin' hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought I didn't know anything\Nabout that, then you're dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your old friend Jaguar de Sol was a\Nvice-admiral before he betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mother, Olvia, was an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know about your\Nhometown of Ohara as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite the tragic tale, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.48,0:06:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And why do I know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the man who\Ncommanded the raid on Ohara,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,uncovered their crimes, then blew the\Nisland to smithereens with a Buster Call?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,was the chief of CP9 who preceded me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise known as my father, Spandine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, scholars of Ohara, I'm afraid your\Ndeath sentence has already been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.20,0:07:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.10,0:07:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You left us no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohara knows too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.64,0:07:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I invoke the Buster Call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.04,0:07:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.22,0:07:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, take her and go, Saul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, I want to stay with you, mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I was happy to hear\Nyou call me back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.42,0:08:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.52,0:08:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For my sake as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You must live, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time, they thought that everyone\Nin Ohara had been nicely eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.76,0:08:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But they found out later that one little\Nbrat had slipped through their fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Running from one money-grubbing\Nadult to the next,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,hoping you weren't either\Nkilled or sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.50,0:08:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single person you\Ncould trust no matter where
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you went nowhere to lay your\Nlittle head down in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.34,0:08:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing to eat what a vile\Nand wretched existence
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,you've had why it's too\Nappalling to even think about
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,sad enough to make you cry huh 20 years\Nago my old man put that bounty on your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,little hand, all for world peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some gratitude, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we finally have our happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The son completes the father's crusade\Nagainst the devils of Ohara, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.66,0:09:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,wrongs of 20 years ago have\Nbeen made right at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohara is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.18,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Robin. But be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.24,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mama's a wonderful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohara's a wonderful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you to pass it on, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.32,0:09:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohara was so brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.76,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They fought against the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohara won't die as long as I live. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.20,0:09:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long is that going to be? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The egg went off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.28,0:10:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, no harm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell for the landmine. Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to rescue me still that was close\Nit's a good thing i had my backup plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on let's go i'm so angry i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,even speak all right marine set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here now.\NUnderstood, sir. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,move yes sir i can't hold\Nback the tears anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch carefully men because you're about\Nto witness the first step of a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that is destined to go down in history!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Chief? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He was hit! We're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.10,0:11:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one on the bridge but us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be hiding somewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone start searching!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.92,0:11:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Betrayed, sir, but we don't\Nknow where the enemy's at!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he's standing on top of the\Ntower of law what's he doing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.26,0:12:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there, it's so far away.\NHow the hell's he hitting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he using a slingshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.84,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The wind runs like crazy, and\Nhe's all the way over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's still hitting\Nhis mark every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Long Nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bam, eat that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.84,0:12:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sniper is number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.34,0:12:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right, bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.64,0:12:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Robin, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do without the singing, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.44,0:12:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.82,0:12:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you idiots doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.82,0:12:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot that guy already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.65,0:13:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,sir, but he's too far away for our bullets\Nto reach, let alone to actually hit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but he's\Ngot us totally outclassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin is getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot her down, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.10,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot her just dead\Nenough to keep her alive
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.24,0:14:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.82,0:14:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets are no problem\Nwhen you're made of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But that landmine wasn't\Nvery nice, Spanda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Sniper King! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can read you\Nloud and clear, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.13,0:14:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the snail from Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be a red bundle\Non the ground next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Red bundle?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see it. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It has two keys inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.22,0:14:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with the ones you have,\Nthat should be all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they get the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And my mission is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.48,0:14:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.06,0:15:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Number one, number three,\Nnumber four, number five.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.56,0:15:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in the clear yet. But wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.50,0:15:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They really did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,A bunch of useless pirates\Nbeat every last member of CP9?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.66,0:15:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have just stolen\Nthe keys and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.80,0:15:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, bunch of cheaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.34,0:15:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the handcuffs off\NRobin, no problem! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.52,0:15:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Longhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.02,0:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That was wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the least I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The true heroes are those who fought\Nto retrieve those keys from the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.64,0:16:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats will be\Nproud to have you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your head up high and meet them\Nwith a smile when all of this has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, c'est fleur.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.64,0:16:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Slap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting a long time to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.26,0:16:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your asses over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get everything ready for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.68,0:16:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna bail. Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down here already, Sniper King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The prisoners escaped from the\Nsame prism stone handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.86,0:16:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Regroup and recapture her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything went according to my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.64,0:17:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.08,0:17:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The battleships are firing on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I took out the stockade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.72,0:17:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,our cannon fire landed a\Ndirect hit on the stockade
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.38,0:17:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,at four o 'clock in\Nfront of the main island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Um?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any reason why\Nthat should matter to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, I guess not, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a thorough, indiscriminate attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.88,0:18:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I only care if we don't hit something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.18,0:18:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to bomb everything\Non this island into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They blew a hole in the\Nfence around the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a pretty massive explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.08,0:18:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got enough room to steer a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,fleet through there and\Nrain fire all over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.98,0:18:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The whirlpools that usually surround\Nthe island have completely vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.62,0:18:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If they aren't around to keep ships out\Nand the Gates of Justice are wide open,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.08,0:18:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing to stop the attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess those whirlpools were\Nonly there because the gates
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.52,0:18:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,were blocking the flow of\Nthe current to the waterfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.12,0:18:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So now that the gates are open,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.52,0:18:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the current is a straight\Nshot to the falls
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and is smooth sailing for\Nall those battleships.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are about to get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we better get\Nmoving while we still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sniper King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have gotten serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.04,0:18:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and jump down from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.06,0:18:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that supposed to be a joke? First off,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.68,0:19:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the same kind of freakish\Nsuperhuman strength that you guys have,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.93,0:19:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And while perfectly ample, my\Nbravery is not the life-risking kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.72,0:19:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed, I'm a\Nnormal superhero, not a super-superhero!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They bombed the Tower of Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.06,0:19:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Longnose was...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.02,0:19:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They took out the Tower of Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's falling over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope those guys are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That wasn't just some\Naccidental explosion up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get off this damn island!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.94,0:20:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.79,0:20:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.46,0:20:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.26,0:20:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone say my name!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you make us think you were dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.00,0:20:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys couldn't even be bothered to catch\Na hero who's plunged off an exploding,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,falling building?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.51,0:20:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Some friends you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Franky, Robin, we're all okay over\Nhere and we're heading your way now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness well we\Nbetter get things in order
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.06,0:21:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,how you feeling right now\Nyou think you're up for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,a fight of course what\Nthe hell are you waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,for wait them out before\Ntheir backup arrives yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,sir you noticed the ship\Non the other side of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the bridge right i'm\Nthinking it's our best chance
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to get out of this mess\Nwell we're already wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.14,0:21:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,criminals we might as\Nwell steal Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now raise them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.98,0:21:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.66,0:22:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like you're doping\Nyourself with your own blood
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.30,0:22:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You use your legs as pumps\Nto accelerate your blood flow
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.20,0:22:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing you're not an ordinary\Nhuman That kind of blood pressure would
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.90,0:22:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,make your heart burst But since your\Ninternal organs are made of rubber,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.02,0:22:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you can handle it A technique only\Nsomeone like you could use But
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that doesn't mean you should it's\Nobvious that you're pushing your
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.22,0:22:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,body too far and I doubt that you\Ncan take much more not very clever
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,are you you're shortening your own\Nlifespan just for a few minutes of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,strength it's better than letting\Nyou take away everything I care
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.50,0:22:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about I'll do anything to keep that\Nfrom happening but you've still lost
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,even if you do defeat me you must\Nhave felt that explosion earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a pretty safe bet that was a\Nbattleship launching a warm-up shot
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.32,0:22:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't be too much longer before\Nthey start a full-scale bombardment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And for all we know, your friends at\Nthe Tower of Law could be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.56,0:22:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're already running\Nthrough the underground
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.68,0:22:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,passageways trying to get\Nhere in time to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.85,0:23:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tempest!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You might defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.74,0:23:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't stop this\Nseawater from flooding the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,tunnel and drowning anyone\Nwho happens to be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.10,0:23:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.82,0:23:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Face the facts, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing's going your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.68,0:23:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't let me stop you from trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.26,0:23:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm interested to see\Nhow far you'll go in your
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,misguided attempts to\Nsave your little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a game we're playing, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokoro! Chimney! Kenpo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for leaving the guide marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.46,0:24:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.60,0:24:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the pirate lady! Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys feel that giant tremor?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.74,0:24:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the party's\Nstarting up there for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.88,0:24:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Cannon fire! Cannon fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.76,0:24:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed it up, you goons!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.24,0:24:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Nico Robin captured\Non that ship, Po' Sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:24:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have long!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.04,0:25:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The battleships are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.80,0:25:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, we're out of time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.68,0:25:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look behind the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The ships are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.30,0:25:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.26,0:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you running?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.24,0:25:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.74,0:25:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked for it, Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.94,0:25:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The Buster Call is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.12,0:26:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The invocation of merciless death,\Nthe Buster Call has finally begun!
